Third-party data
----------------

The APK bundles these dictionaries unmodified. They are imported on first launch.

JMdict (English) (https://www.edrdg.org/wiki/index.php/JMdict-EDICT_Dictionary_Project), CC BY-SA 4.0,
  by the Electronic Dictionary Research and Development Group, used in conformance with the Group's
