  (https://github.com/yomidevs/jmdict-yomitan), MIT License.

Jiten frequency list (https://jiten.moe), CC BY-SA 4.0.

Kanjium pitch accents (https://github.com/toasted-nutbread/yomichan-pitch-accent-dictionary),
  data from Kanjium (https://github.com/mifunetoshiro/kanjium), CC BY-SA 4.0;
  conversion by toasted-nutbread, MIT License.
